{"id":1060201,"chapter_id":1060201,"scene_id":1,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"蓝色衣裙的女性端坐在审查室内。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160201001,"trial_step":1,"drawing":1060200},{"step":2,"content":"她的脸上一如既往地带着微笑，第一次见到她的时候，也是这样。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160201002,"trial_step":2,"drawing":1060200},{"step":3,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"好久不见，昏睡的这段时间，给你添麻烦了。","voice":["vo_trial_60201_1_5"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160201005,"trial_step":5,"drawing":1060200},{"step":4,"content":"魔女之夜事件解决后，因为吸收了那些暴走的力量，觉醒成为狂厄级禁闭者，恩菲尔陷入了昏睡之中，直到这几天才苏醒过来。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160201006,"trial_step":6,"drawing":1060200},{"step":5,"content":"从医师那里得知她的状态恢复得不错后，你便决定过来见见她。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160201007,"trial_step":7,"drawing":1060200},{"step":6,"options":["没有，这是我的职责"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":160201008,"trial_step":8,"course":3,"drawing":1060200,"choices":[{"text":"没有，这是我的职责","goto":9}]},{"step":7,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"职责……哈哈……","voice":["vo_trial_60201_1_9"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160201009,"trial_step":9,"drawing":1060201},{"step":8,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"这个词听上去，会让我觉得我们之间的关系，很疏离。","voice":["vo_trial_60201_1_10"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160201010,"trial_step":10,"drawing":1060200},{"step":9,"content":"恩菲尔抬起手，比划了一下你与她之间的距离。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160201011,"trial_step":11,"drawing":1060200},{"step":10,"content":"抱歉，这只是例行的一环。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160201012,"trial_step":12,"drawing":1060200},{"step":11,"content":"我没有要为难你的意思。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160201013,"trial_step":13,"drawing":1060200},{"step":12,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"放心，我也没有。","voice":["vo_trial_60201_1_14"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160201014,"trial_step":14,"drawing":1060200},{"step":13,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"不过……局长大人亲自过来一趟，总不能真的只是为了跟我打个招呼吧。","voice":["vo_trial_60201_1_15"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160201015,"trial_step":15,"drawing":1060200},{"step":14,"content":"的确不止，但我希望你好好的。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160201016,"trial_step":16,"drawing":1060200},{"step":15,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"托你的福。","voice":["vo_trial_60201_1_17"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160201017,"trial_step":17,"drawing":1060201},{"step":16,"content":"那很好。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160201018,"trial_step":18,"drawing":1060201},{"step":17,"content":"虽然我觉得这可能有些……急促，但因为这也是我想知道的事情，所以……","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160201019,"trial_step":19,"drawing":1060200},{"step":18,"content":"如果你认为你暂时还无法回答这些问题，我们可以慢慢来。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160201020,"trial_step":20,"drawing":1060200},{"step":19,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"说吧，我没有那么脆弱。","voice":["vo_trial_60201_1_21"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160201021,"trial_step":21,"drawing":1060200},{"step":20,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置1","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":22,"course":6,"drawing":1060200},{"step":21,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置2","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":22,"course":6,"drawing":1060200},{"step":22,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置3","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":22,"course":6,"drawing":1060200},{"step":23,"options":["选择1"],"jump":[5],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":22,"course":6,"drawing":1060200},{"step":24,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置4","style":18,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":22,"course":6,"drawing":1060200},{"step":25,"options":["选择1","选择2"],"jump":[7,9],"style":4,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":22,"course":6,"drawing":1060200},{"step":26,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置5，对应选择1","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":22,"course":6,"drawing":1060200},{"step":27,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置5，对应选择2","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":22,"course":6,"drawing":1060200},{"step":28,"content":"这是贝尔芬格美术馆的现状资料。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160201023,"trial_step":23,"drawing":1060200},{"step":29,"content":"尽管你已经将魔女之夜吸收，我也为你套上了枷锁，但我们都没有弄清楚，魔女之夜的力量究竟来源于何处。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160201024,"trial_step":24,"drawing":1060200},{"step":30,"content":"恩菲尔看着你摆在桌面上的资料与照片，一言不发。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160201025,"trial_step":25,"drawing":1060200},{"step":31,"content":"她的指尖轻轻点着那些照片——那些照片里，展出在贝尔芬格的作品，几乎都成为了碎片。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160201026,"trial_step":26,"drawing":1060200},{"step":32,"content":"抱歉，我是不是不应该给你看……","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160201027,"trial_step":27,"drawing":1060200},{"step":33,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"不要紧。","voice":["vo_trial_60201_1_28"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160201028,"trial_step":28,"drawing":1060201},{"step":34,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"弄坏它们的也不是你。","voice":["vo_trial_60201_1_29"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160201029,"trial_step":29,"drawing":1060201},{"step":35,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"继续吧。","voice":["vo_trial_60201_1_30"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160201030,"trial_step":30,"drawing":1060201},{"step":36,"content":"你看了看恩菲尔，咬咬牙，继续说道。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160201031,"trial_step":31,"drawing":1060200},{"step":37,"content":"魔女之夜的力量，是足够强大到让一位普通禁闭者，进化成为狂厄级禁闭者。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160201032,"trial_step":32,"drawing":1060200},{"step":38,"content":"就算是亲历者，我也仍然无法弄清楚这个力量的最初来源。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160201033,"trial_step":33,"drawing":1060200},{"step":39,"content":"来源未知，进化原因未知，更可怕的是……上限也未知。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160201034,"trial_step":34,"drawing":1060200},{"step":40,"content":"你也知道，新城……向来对狂厄有所偏见，他们拒绝出面处理贝尔芬格美术馆的善后工作。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160201035,"trial_step":35,"drawing":1060200},{"step":41,"content":"因为对魔女之夜还没有完全了解清楚，所以……某种意义上来说，魔女之夜带来的恐惧和慌乱，仍未结束。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160201036,"trial_step":36,"drawing":1060200},{"step":42,"options":["恩菲尔……我需要你的帮助"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":160201037,"trial_step":37,"course":3,"drawing":1060200,"choices":[{"text":"恩菲尔……我需要你的帮助","goto":38}]},{"step":43,"content":"恩菲尔收回摩挲着照片的手，抬起头来，定定地看着你。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160201038,"trial_step":38,"drawing":1060200},{"step":44,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"我不知道。","voice":["vo_trial_60201_1_39"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160201039,"trial_step":39,"drawing":1060200},{"step":45,"content":"可是……","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160201040,"trial_step":40,"drawing":1060200},{"step":46,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"在你为我套上枷锁之前，我并不清楚什么是禁闭者。","voice":["vo_trial_60201_1_41"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160201041,"trial_step":41,"drawing":1060204},{"step":47,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"我也不知道为什么，魔女之夜的力量，能让我成为你口中“狂厄级别”的存在。","voice":["vo_trial_60201_1_42"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160201042,"trial_step":42,"drawing":1060204},{"step":48,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"但既然它能促成这样的结局，或许说明……魔女之夜的力量，和禁闭者的力量是一致的。","voice":["vo_trial_60201_1_43"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160201043,"trial_step":43,"drawing":1060204},{"step":49,"content":"恩菲尔撑着脸，似乎陷入了沉思。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160201044,"trial_step":44,"drawing":1060204},{"step":50,"content":"那么……你的意思是，禁闭者和魔女之夜的力量来源，是一致的？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160201045,"trial_step":45,"drawing":1060204},{"step":51,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"嗯……所以……","voice":["vo_trial_60201_1_46"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160201046,"trial_step":46,"drawing":1060204},{"step":52,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"禁闭者的力量，源于哪里？","voice":["vo_trial_60201_1_47"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160201047,"trial_step":47,"drawing":1060200},{"step":53,"content":"恩菲尔看着你，眼神中透露着一丝若有似无的渴望。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160201048,"trial_step":48,"drawing":1060200},{"step":54,"content":"你抬了抬手，示意她看向自己心口那枚青蓝色的心形装饰。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160201049,"trial_step":49,"drawing":1060200},{"step":55,"content":"我想，禁闭者的力量，应该源于自己的内心。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160201050,"trial_step":50,"drawing":1060200},{"step":56,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160201051,"trial_step":51,"drawing":1060205},{"step":57,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"如果你是对的……","voice":["vo_trial_60201_1_52"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160201052,"trial_step":52,"drawing":1060205},{"step":58,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"你是局长，你是禁闭者们的管理者……你理应是对的。","voice":["vo_trial_60201_1_53"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160201053,"trial_step":53,"drawing":1060205},{"step":59,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"照你这么说，魔女之夜的力量，难道源于我的内心吗？","voice":["vo_trial_60201_1_54"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160201054,"trial_step":54,"drawing":1060205},{"step":60,"content":"我想，魔女之夜的力量一部分来自帕尔马的石料，一部分来自参观者内心的恐惧。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160201055,"trial_step":55,"drawing":1060204},{"step":61,"content":"但吸收接纳一切，觉醒成狂厄级禁闭者并且战胜了魔女之夜……这样的力量来自于你的内心。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160201056,"trial_step":56,"drawing":1060204},{"step":62,"content":"恩菲尔笑了笑，却又沉默不语。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160201057,"trial_step":57,"drawing":1060204},{"step":63,"content":"禁闭者……在觉醒的时刻，内心是充盈着某些思绪，情感的，或者是……欲望。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160201058,"trial_step":58,"drawing":1060204},{"step":64,"content":"你能想起些什么吗？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160201059,"trial_step":59,"drawing":1060204},{"step":65,"content":"恩菲尔看着你，又一次笑了起来。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160201060,"trial_step":60,"drawing":1060200},{"step":66,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"你和我都是魔女之夜的亲历者，难道还不明白吗？","voice":["vo_trial_60201_1_61"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160201061,"trial_step":61,"drawing":1060200},{"step":67,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"对我来说，我内心所追求的一直都是恐惧。","voice":["vo_trial_60201_1_62"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160201062,"trial_step":62,"drawing":1060202},{"step":68,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"这才是人们内心之中的真实，才是世界的真实。","voice":["vo_trial_60201_1_63"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160201063,"trial_step":63,"drawing":1060202},{"step":69,"content":"恩菲尔点了点桌面上的照片，照片上，是一尊破败的雕塑。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160201064,"trial_step":64,"drawing":1060200},{"step":70,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"比如，风的痕迹……","voice":["vo_trial_60201_1_65"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160201065,"trial_step":65,"drawing":1060200},{"step":71,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"世界上的一切，就算是风，也是会留下痕迹的。","voice":["vo_trial_60201_1_66"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160201066,"trial_step":66,"drawing":1060200},{"step":72,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"当它把病痛、哭嚎、绝望吹遍这世间后，留下的就是这魔鬼一般的枯枝。","voice":["vo_trial_60201_1_67"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160201067,"trial_step":67,"drawing":1060200},{"step":73,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"我们的身边，到处都是这样的枯枝，这便是风所倾诉的真实。","voice":["vo_trial_60201_1_68"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160201068,"trial_step":68,"drawing":1060200},{"step":74,"content":"恩菲尔将手里的照片划开，正准备再告诉你下一张“恐惧真相”时，却停住了。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160201069,"trial_step":69,"drawing":1060200},{"step":75,"content":"那张照片上，破败不堪的雕塑，是索西亚。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160201070,"trial_step":70,"drawing":1060204},{"step":76,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"可索西亚……好像并不一样……","voice":["vo_trial_60201_1_71"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160201071,"trial_step":71,"drawing":1060204},{"step":77,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"她明明是我创造出来的作品，却似乎比我自己要更加了解自己。","voice":["vo_trial_60201_1_72"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160201072,"trial_step":72,"drawing":1060204},{"step":78,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"她认为我迷茫，我软弱……认为我的恐惧并不纯粹，认为我不了解我自己。","voice":["vo_trial_60201_1_73"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160201073,"trial_step":73,"drawing":1060204},{"step":79,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"——她觉得我一直都没有抛弃